 otherwise. Cost is about $1.40.\n3. Bridge 0.001 ETH from eth1 to arb1 as gas. Cost is about $1.40.\n4. Bridge 247,500 WBTC from eth1 to rh1. About 246,666 arrives. Cost is about $1.40.\n5. Bridge 247,500 WBTC from eth1 to arb1. About 246,666 arrives. Cost is about $1.40.\n6. Swap WBTC to ETH on rh1. Expected output is about 0.0492 ETH. Cost is about $0.36.\n7. Swap WBTC to USDC on arb1. Expected output is about 147.70 USDC. Cost is about $0.36.\n\n- **Gas:** eth1 keeps about 0.048 ETH, which is above its 0.0003 ETH per-transaction reserve.\n- **Rejected alternative:** swapping to USDC on Ethereum and bridging it would cost about $3.90 for that swap alone.\n- **Execution:** I'll run the legs one at a time, checking the destination balance after each.\n\nApprove to proceed (approval_id `appr_9`)."}]},{"role":"user","sequence":22,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, go ahead with that plan."}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":23,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","arguments":{"quote_id":"q_1","approval_id":"appr_9"},"id":"toolu_01TixEaMbrEMChMQtCKtwiq5"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":24,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"tx_id\":\"tx_10\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01TixEaMbrEMChMQtCKtwiq5","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":25,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","arguments":{"tx_id":"tx_10"},"id":"toolu_017WgFfCr1w1M517p1BoVJSo"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":26,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"status\":\"confirmed\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_017WgFfCr1w1M517p1BoVJSo","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":27,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_get_balance","arguments":{"account":"eth1","asset":"WBTC"},"id":"toolu_01P9LvrhCYgqXNvgjTcSu7xX"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":28,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"amount\":\"49500